{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600130","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1260013001:1":{"text":"一切尘埃落定，锈锚港的颂神广场上，索尼娅清了清嗓子，向期待了许久的民众开口。","source_cn":"一切尘埃落定，锈锚港的颂神广场上，索尼娅清了清嗓子，向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785279F16A3A7157","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1260013002:1":{"text":"各位，晚上好。我不擅长长篇大论，所以就简短地致辞。","source_cn":"各位，晚上好。我不擅长长篇大论，所以就简短地致辞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE86EC9B349EB96F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260013003:1":{"text":"我们过去曾经经历过无数次的危机，战斗、欺骗、贫穷、暴力……既有从外部而来，亦有内部产生。","source_cn":"我们过去曾经经历过无数次的危机，战斗、欺骗、贫穷、暴力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A01AB4D6AC84FC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260013004:1":{"text":"那段痛苦而混乱的时光，对于大家而言，应该仍然记忆犹新。","source_cn":"那段痛苦而混乱的时光，对于大家而言，应该仍然记忆犹新。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A179B81111FE4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260013005:1":{"text":"然而，就像永远不会被海浪侵蚀的崖岸一样，锈锚港，以及我们，永远也不会认输。","source_cn":"然而，就像永远不会被海浪侵蚀的崖岸一样，锈锚港，以及我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE5B6481ACC5FE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260013006:1":{"text":"今天是秋夜节，是庆祝丰收，纪念英灵的节日！","source_cn":"今天是秋夜节，是庆祝丰收，纪念英灵的节日！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CDA1BF8F84CB117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260013007:1":{"text":"为了怀念那些离去的伙伴，为了庆祝今日的安宁，为了迎接将来的美好生活——","source_cn":"为了怀念那些离去的伙伴，为了庆祝今日的安宁，为了迎接将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D336B6D1A97A80D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1260013008:1":{"text":"今夜，尽情欢乐吧。\n秋夜节庆典，正式开始！！","source_cn":"今夜，尽情欢乐吧。\\n秋夜节庆典，正式开始！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49C94F7BB92680C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1260013009:1":{"text":"伴随着索尼娅的宣告，七彩缤纷的烟花在夜空中轰然炸开，辉煌绚丽的光焰流洒而下，照亮了漆黑的海面，与下方欢呼大笑的人群……","source_cn":"伴随着索尼娅的宣告，七彩缤纷的烟花在夜空中轰然炸开，辉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C4680BC9E38006C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260013010:0":{"text":"烟花……呼金，做得不错。竟然真的赶上节日开始了。","source_cn":"烟花……呼金，做得不错。竟然真的赶上节日开始了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0558AEF2FC70BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum